      "headline": "One click.\nTwo orders.",
      "subhead": "Retry without a key duplicates the write.",
      "narration": "Client ko lagta hai request fail hui, so woh retry karta hai. Naive server same INSERT dobara chala deta hai. Ab ek click se do orders ban gaye.",
