      "headline": "Timeout ≠ fail.\nUnknown.",
      "subhead": "Mint one stable key before the first POST.",
      "narration": "Yahi key insight hai: timeout ka matlab operation fail nahi. Matlab client ko outcome pata nahi. Isliye first request se pehle ek stable idempotency key banao.",
